{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/e5ecc117fbe4fc6119d5cc96fe201709.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/e5ecc117fbe4fc6119d5cc96fe201709.webm?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/e5ecc117fbe4fc6119d5cc96fe201709.mp4?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the unforgiving depths...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge your path through a realm shatered by a magic comet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Shifters is a action RPG set in the year 0 of a world catastrophe. This game challenges you to uncover unseen magic and survive what lies beneath it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Dungeon Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into dungeons filled with paths, blocked passages, hidden rooms and ancient devices. Discover forgotten murals, lore fragments, and puzzles as you piece together a dark history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/728327c22ce6d7faf04450aa120a7dfd.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/728327c22ce6d7faf04450aa120a7dfd.webm?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/728327c22ce6d7faf04450aa120a7dfd.mp4?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Person Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face foes in a slow-paced, strategic combat system. Stamina management, precise timing, and reading enemy patterns are critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/b45a633304d4cdb23334cd5808a6b465.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/b45a633304d4cdb23334cd5808a6b465.webm?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/b45a633304d4cdb23334cd5808a6b465.mp4?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/bc355f9c38180b2c445c63afb8fe10cd.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/bc355f9c38180b2c445c63afb8fe10cd.webm?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/bc355f9c38180b2c445c63afb8fe10cd.mp4?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Three Distinct Playable Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own combat rhythm, role, and gear preferences:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hammer Warrior</strong>: Durable, area-focused melee bruiser\u2014great at crowd control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Longsword Warrior</strong>: Agile duelist built for 1v1 scenarios and reactive counterplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water Mage</strong>: Long-range spellcaster who manipulates elemental magic on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/6fdc6c9a94556ad4074073abd360b0f4.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/6fdc6c9a94556ad4074073abd360b0f4.webm?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/6fdc6c9a94556ad4074073abd360b0f4.mp4?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies with Distinct Behavior</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shieldbearers</strong> will block your frontal attacks and force repositioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swordberserkers</strong> lunge from long range to punish poor spacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wailing Archers</strong> will rain down cursed arrows that disrupt spellcasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Bosses </strong>that you must defeat using everything you\u2019ve learned to clear the dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter pushes you to learn, adapt, and conquer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/5e322bc8db362124998fbf59bbda69a9.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/5e322bc8db362124998fbf59bbda69a9.webm?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/5e322bc8db362124998fbf59bbda69a9.mp4?t=1755006479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling in a Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Dungeon Shifters is complex and full of secrets. Uncover its history through forgotten scriptures, murals, and visual cues hidden throughout your descent. The deeper you go, the clearer the truth becomes\u2014if you survive to see it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to descend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path you choose, every enemy you face, and every secret you uncover will shape your story. <strong>Uncover the forgotten. Shift the fate of your world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/e8e3bff65c75b32c1771443619d9988c.avif?t=1755006479\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420720?t=1755006479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420720?t=1755006479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/c082e9e98b9bf479df32e0410947df8c025a2301/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755006479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/c082e9e98b9bf479df32e0410947df8c025a2301/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755006479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/e5ecc117fbe4fc6119d5cc96fe201709.poster.avif?t=1755006479\" width=598