n scriptures, murals, and visual cues hidden throughout your descent. The deeper you go, the clearer the truth becomes\u2014if you survive to see it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to descend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every path you choose, every enemy you face, and every secret you uncover will shape your story. <strong>Uncover the forgotten. Shift the fate of your world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/extras/e8e3bff65c75b32c1771443619d9988c.avif?t=1755006479\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Shifting Realms "],"fullgame":{"appid":"3403100","name":"Dungeon Shifters"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420720/dbf77033321a072908f00e6c40904b53a5d037c6/header.jpg?t=1755006479","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dungeon Shifters Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Muviron SpA"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Derbe Sprache\n\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"12 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Dungeon Shifters is an action RPG set in a world broken by a magic comet. Explore ancient dungeons, uncover lost secrets, and battle deadly ememies in third-person combat. Choose your adventurer and shape your fate in the depths.","steam_appid":3420720,"support_info":{"email":"dungeonshifters@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":"https://www.